         <th aria-label="2031" data-stat="contract_y5" scope="col" class=" poptip center" data-tip="&lt;strong&gt;Player Status Prior to Season for Future Seasons&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dollars&lt;/strong&gt; alone indicate a guaranteed contract&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dollars and [*]&lt;/strong&gt; indicates value is a buyout, mouseover [*] for option value,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;[FA-*] or [Arb-*]&lt;/strong&gt; indicate status if option is declined.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pre-Arb-Y&lt;/strong&gt; indicates year of pre-arbitration eligibility.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Arb-Y&lt;/strong&gt; indicates year of arbitration eligibility. Players with Arb-4 are Super Twos or expected to be.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FA&lt;/strong&gt; indicates the player will enter free agency prior to the season.">2031</th>
         <th aria-label="2032" data-stat="contract_y6" scope="col" class=" poptip center" data-tip="&lt;strong&gt;Player Status Prior to Season for Future Seasons&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dollars&lt;/strong&gt; alone indicate a guaranteed contract&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dollars and [*]&lt;/strong&gt; indicates value is a buyout, mouseover [*] for option value,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;[FA-*] or [Arb-*]&lt;/strong&gt; indicate status if option is declined.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pre-Arb-Y&lt;/strong&gt; indicates year of pre-arbitration eligibility.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Arb-Y&lt;/strong&gt; indicates year of arbitration eligibility. Players with Arb-4 are Super Twos or expected to be.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FA&lt;/strong&gt; indicates the player will enter free agency prior to the season.">2032</th>
